## 1. Executive Summary

This document outlines the project management plan for the upcoming building project "Green Valley Residential Complex" located in Springfield, Illinois. The project aims to construct a multifamily residential complex consisting of 120 units, with the primary goal of providing affordable housing in the rapidly developing area. This comprehensive plan covers all aspects of the project, including stakeholder engagement, contractor selection, materials procurement, safety protocols, permitting processes, timelines, and budget estimates.

## 2. Project Overview

### 2.1 Project Objectives

- Construct a multifamily residential complex with 120 units.
- Complete the project within 18 months, starting from January 15, 2024.
- Adhere to the budget of $15 million.
- Ensure compliance with local building codes and safety standards.

### 2.2 Locations

- **Project Site:** 101 Green Valley Lane, Springfield, IL
- **Office Location:** 200 Corporate Plaza, Springfield, IL
- **Key Suppliers:** Various locations throughout Illinois and neighboring states.

